        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ch%C5%8Dfu",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Jindaiji Temple, founded in 733 AD, is Tokyo's second‑oldest temple and still draws visitors to its 400‑year‑old soba tradition.",
