      ],
      "source": "https://www.japan-experience.com/all-about-japan/tokyo/attractions-excursions/chofu",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Chōfu sits on the Musashino Terrace, about 20 km west of downtown Tokyo, bordered by the Tama and Iruma river floodplains.",
